  "lever-bengaluru-meesho-dea44a88-b138-4ef0-87b0-ed8440b0a331": "About the team ValMo is Meesho\u2019s logistics and supply chain organization, responsible for building India\u2019s most cost-efficient, reliable, and scalable fulfillment network. From first-mile pickup to last-mile delivery and reverse logistics, ValMo powers millions of shipments every month for small businesses across the country. Valmo (Meesho\u2019s Logistics Arm) is building India\u2019s largest and most efficient hyperlocal self-pickup network: Meesho Pickup Point. We are partnering with local Kiranas, pharmacies, and telecom shops to serve as highly dense, zero-effort pickup points for our prepaid\u2026",
  "lever-bengaluru-meesho-19d34992-cc3d-4066-9de4-69c17f952ba1": "About the Team We\u2019re revolutionizing the way India shops \u2014 and we need curious, driven minds like yours to lead the charge.Imagine seeing your favorite influencer in a show-stopping outfit, only to find there\u2019s no way to buy it online. Frustrating, right? That\u2019s the very gap we\u2019re solving at Meesho through Content Commerce and additionally trying to shape more influencers become entrepreneurs\u2014 and you could be at the heart of it.As our next Senior Associate \u2013 CC, you\u2019ll play a pivotal role in solving one of the most common yet unexplored problems in Indian e-commerce: how to connect\u2026",
